      },
      "text": "Built on former industrial site, the Center acts as gateway between Roosevelt Park and Santa Clara Street; a neighborhood business district and VTA Bus Rapid Transit corridor. It is accessible via public transit and bicycle:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11655773420479303,
        "y0": 0.4894781144781145,
        "x1": 0.5375816993464052,
        "y1": 0.5521885521885521
      },
      "text": "WATER EFFICIENCY_Rainwater is collected and filtered onsite through planted basins, then to irrigate landscaped areas Metered faucets and low-flow toilets reduce indoor water consumption by 34 percent as compared to a standard building: used",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11710239651416122,
        "y0": 0.5749158249158249,
        "x1": 0.5354030501089325,
        "y1": 0.6376262626262627
      },
      "text": "ENERGY & EMISSIONS_Natural light and motion sensors reduce the need for electric lighting: A highly insulated roof and exterior walls help make the building 44 percent more energy efficient than required by the State Building Code.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11655773420479303,
        "y0": 0.6595117845117846,
        "x1": 0.5408496732026143,
        "y1": 0.7525252525252525
      },
      "text": "MATERIALS & WASTE_More than 14 percent of building materials used for the Center include recycled content; 30 percent were manufactured within a 5oo-mile radius, and over 86 percent of the construction wood is FSC (Forest Stewardship Council) certified which means it came responsibly managed forests. from",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11601307189542484,
        "y0": 0.7756734006734007,
        "x1": 0.5299564270152505,
        "y1": 0.8350168350168351
      },
      "text": "HEALTH & SAFETY_No- and low-VOC (volatile organic compound) emitting finishes and paints were chosen for the building interior. This contributes to healthier indoor air quality for staff and visitors_",
